</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He has entered! He has entered!</l><l>Vanish every doubt and sin;</l><l>He has taken full possession,</l><l>He is Lord of all within.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Long at my poor heart He tarried,</l><l>Knocking with His wounded hand;</l><l>Wide at last to Him I opened,</l><l>Yielding all to His command.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>He has entered! He has entered!</l><l>Every sorrow now must flee;</l><l>Where He reigns as King and Master,</l><l>There no grief can ever be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
